1
00:01:37,850 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,660
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:45,890
[Episode 8]

4
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,400
As expected,

5
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,470
at this time of year,

6
00:02:15,550 --> 00:02:17,280
this is the only place
around Tianhuang City

7
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,400
where Dragon-whisker Grass

8
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,970
can be found.

9
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:32,000
The autopsy results
for Yan Zige

10
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,840
are in.

11
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,770
How did it go?

12
00:02:36,829 --> 00:02:39,230
I'm afraid the results may disappoint you.

13
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:41,910
The ventricles were intact,

14
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,590
and there were no other signs of illness.

15
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:45,680
The only explanation is that he died
from external trauma.

16
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,800
But Meng Rui,

17
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:47,840
as I told you,

18
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,240
you're honest
and straightforward by nature.

19
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,840
You couldn't possibly be the killer.

20
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,630
So

21
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:54,150
whether you consider me

22
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,240
a friend or not,

23
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,360
I

24
00:02:56,450 --> 00:02:58,850
will help you get
to the bottom of the truth.

25
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Meng Rui,

26
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:01,800
Tell me about your master.

27
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:05,590
When I had nowhere to go,

28
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,910
he took me in

29
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,650
and taught me martial arts.

30
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,540
I only learned these past few days

31
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:13,530
that he was known
as the Netherworld Swordsman.

32
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:15,360
Why did you have nowhere to go?

33
00:03:17,190 --> 00:03:18,560
When did this happen?

34
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,590
The 20th year of Hongyun.

35
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,079
Why?

36
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,640
Were you an orphan from a young age?

37
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,310
I'm not an orphan.

38
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,850
Then what about your parents?

39
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,640
Do you have any siblings?

40
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,680
Is the Netherworld Swordsman still alive?

41
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,470
He's dead.

42
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,560
Are you sure?

43
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:42,870
I buried him myself.

44
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,900
If that's the case,

45
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,750
I'm afraid the real culprit
behind the black chest case

46
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:49,310
intended from the very beginning

47
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:50,079
to use the legend

48
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:51,960
of the Netherworld Swordsman

49
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:54,150
to create the black chest warnings.

50
00:03:56,310 --> 00:03:58,170
Based on your Severe-Cold Sword,

51
00:03:58,190 --> 00:03:59,270
they deduced

52
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:00,210
that you were

53
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,150
the heir to the Netherworld Swordsman.

54
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:02,960
So they began

55
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,780
carefully laying their plans,

56
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,710
intending to pin the whole thing

57
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,520
on you.

58
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,070
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

59
00:04:25,890 --> 00:04:27,710
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

60
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:31,510
Chief.

61
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,510
Zhenzhu.

62
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:38,360
If you can't make sense of things,

63
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,600
you should go home

64
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,240
and spend some time with your father.

65
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,240
If the culprit really

66
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,430
is connected
to the Netherworld Swordsman,

67
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,120
I suspect their revenge

68
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,159
isn't over yet.

69
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:49,510
Their next target

70
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:53,950
will be the person
who joined forces with the imperial court

71
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:54,950
and the martial world
to hunt down the Netherworld Swordsman

72
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:56,390
back then.

73
00:04:56,750 --> 00:04:57,720
In other words,

74
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,830
my father.

75
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,630
Xuanyuan Shan said

76
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,750
that Northern Kun was forced
to join forces with the Great Shi

77
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:07,160
and, together with Grand Secretary Bai,

78
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,110
issued an order

79
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:10,370
to hunt down the Netherworld Swordsman.

80
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,640
Grand Secretary Bai Qi?

81
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,850
The Divine Constable Bureau matters,

82
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,360
of course,

83
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,640
but family matters, too.

84
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:25,030
Lately, I've been wondering
about something.

85
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,440
Who really stands to gain

86
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:28,300
from Wenbu's death?

87
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,920
I've even suspected the First Prince

88
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,120
and the Crown Prince.

89
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,390
Li Si,

90
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,390
investigating them for my sake

91
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:37,650
puts you at great risk.

92
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:38,870
Actually,

93
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,600
I'm not doing this entirely for you.

94
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,510
There are things

95
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,909
I want to find out myself.

96
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,190
Why don't we

97
00:05:47,190 --> 00:05:48,870
look at it from another angle?

98
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,600
Go on.

99
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,920
If someone wanted
to recreate the circumstances

100
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,159
in the black chest warning exactly
and kill someone that way,

101
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:57,180
how difficult would that be?

102
00:05:57,310 --> 00:05:58,950
Wenbu's timing of taking the poison

103
00:05:58,950 --> 00:06:00,720
could be chalked up to luck.

104
00:06:00,870 --> 00:06:01,900
But...

105
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,920
Yan Zige's death was different.

106
00:06:04,110 --> 00:06:05,040
Neither he nor I knew

107
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,900
what move would be used in the end—

108
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,750
whether it would be a palm strike
or a sword strike.

109
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,410
Yet how could that black chest

110
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,270
possibly know in advance,

111
00:06:12,290 --> 00:06:14,270
with such precision,

112
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:16,800
that Yan Zige would be killed
by a single palm strike from you?

113
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,580
The real culprit went to all that trouble

114
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:20,440
to create the black chest warning

115
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,160
just to frame me?

116
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:23,390
Why?

117
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:26,290
What grudge could they
possibly have against me?

118
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:33,120
What if we look at it
the other way around?

119
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,070
The other way around?

120
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:35,150
What if

121
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,800
the black chest

122
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,070
wasn't merely meant

123
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:40,130
to frame the Netherworld Swordsman,

124
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:42,120
but the warning itself

125
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,800
was an essential part

126
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,680
of the killer's method of murder?

127
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,390
You're saying

128
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,800
you met Mr. Meng?

129
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,800
Don't worry.

130
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:54,390
He's doing just fine.

131
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,690
Did he say anything?

132
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,830
Zhenzhu,

133
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,190
there's something

134
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:00,390
I've been wondering.

135
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,290
Were Yan Zige's ribs

136
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,070
broken?

137
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,560
No.

138
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,680
I found that strange

139
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:15,920
when I examined the body earlier.

140
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,800
No matter how profound
Meng Rui's inner power was,

141
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,950
there was no way

142
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,720
he could have shattered
the heart meridians

143
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,600
through the intact ribs
without leaving a mark on them.

144
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,580
Exactly.

145
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,740
That proves

146
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:29,050
Yan Zige couldn't possibly
have been killed by Meng Rui.

147
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,650
I'll go check again.

148
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,150
Li Si,

149
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,920
thank you.

150
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:38,240
Go ahead.

151
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,050
Your Highness, please,

152
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,600
don't drink anymore.

153
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,600
Watch your step.

154
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:49,630
Your Highness, let's go back
to the Crown Prince's residence.

155
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,230
No, no, no.

156
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:52,720
Your Highness,
you've had too much to drink.

157
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,390
I'm not drunk.

158
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,950
You are. You're drunk.

159
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:57,070
I'm not drunk.

160
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,560
I'm not drunk.

161
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:02,120
Have you heard?

162
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,510
With the war

163
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:05,870
against Northern Kun upon us,

164
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:08,930
says the Ministry of War
under my command

165
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,390
holds the most power.

166
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:11,190
But!

167
00:08:11,190 --> 00:08:11,750
No, no, no.

168
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:12,950
None of you know!

169
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:13,920
Y-Your Highness,
you've had too much to drink.

170
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,390
-Let's not talk about this.
-Actually, all my men

171
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:18,120
are stationed at the frontier.

172
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,560
The capital's defenses

173
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,890
are all under my elder brother's command.

174
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,470
Your Highness,

175
00:08:23,950 --> 00:08:25,390
that's a military secret.

176
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:26,800
You can't tell her that.

177
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:28,390
What military secret?

178
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:30,310
Even a fool knows that.

179
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:31,480
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

180
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,120
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

181
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,750
-Get away!
-Your Highness.

182
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,510
Your Highness.

183
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,419
Go!

184
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:45,150
For 17 years...

185
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,910
For 17 years,

186
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,080
His Majesty has loved watching

187
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,740
my elder brother and me
fight for the upper hand.

188
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,760
-You know that?
-Your Highness.

189
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,490
It's always been like this.

190
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,200
If I lose,

191
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,390
His Majesty helps me

192
00:09:01,390 --> 00:09:02,990
bring down my elder brother.

193
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,960
If His Majesty
sees my elder brother losing,

194
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,190
he helps him turn the tables.

195
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,390
Everyone thinks I'm a fool,

196
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:12,680
but I know exactly what's going on.

197
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,210
Tell me, am I a fool?

198
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:18,960
-Am I? Tell me!
-Your Highness, you're drunk.

199
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,270
-Let's go back to your place.
-Say it! Am I a fool?

200
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,000
Tell me!

201
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,750
Your Highness.

202
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:23,600
Get away!

203
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:24,750
Am I a fool? Tell me!

204
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,480
Your Highness.

205
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:25,960
Say it!

206
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,390
-Your Highness, you're drunk.
-Tell me!

207
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,200
Master.

208
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,360
Your Highness.

209
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,720
-Qingyang.
-Your Highness.

210
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,750
Qingyang.

211
00:09:34,750 --> 00:09:38,270
-Your Highness, take it easy.
-Qingyang, you're finally here.

212
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,130
Your Highness.

213
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,550
Don't you think I'm a fool,

214
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,480
Qingyang?

215
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,360
Don't you think I'm a fool?

216
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,130
Your Highness,

217
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:49,080
you're drunk.

218
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:51,200
Qingyang,

219
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:53,400
I... I can't carry him.

220
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:54,890
Your Highness.

221
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,670
I can't carry the Crown Prince either.

222
00:09:57,770 --> 00:09:59,670
I'll help His Highness back

223
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:01,320
to the Crown Prince's residence.

224
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,840
Master, I've found something regarding

225
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,360
what you asked me to look into last time.

226
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,320
On the 9th day of the 2nd month
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

227
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,360
the Ministry of War sent out

228
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,910
an urgent military dispatch
by express courier.

229
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,200
As for the specific contents,

230
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,200
I wasn't able

231
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,750
to find out.

232
00:10:15,910 --> 00:10:17,200
Military intelligence
is highly classified,

233
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,920
so it was difficult
to uncover the details.

234
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:19,960
I don't blame you.

235
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,420
That dispatch not only
reached His Majesty,

236
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:25,790
but also made its way
to the Crown Prince's residence.

237
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,940
So that's it—they joined forces.

238
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,870
Something else happened that day

239
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:33,200
that shook the realm:

240
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:35,590
Fourth Prince Zhou Yan died of illness.

241
00:10:35,660 --> 00:10:36,810
A month later,

242
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,080
the First Prince handed over

243
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,290
the seal of the Ministry of War.

244
00:10:39,290 --> 00:10:40,350
Most of the First Prince's men

245
00:10:40,350 --> 00:10:42,550
were replaced by the Crown Prince's men.

246
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:44,970
There were extensive personnel changes.

247
00:10:48,050 --> 00:10:49,850
This is the list we've compiled.

248
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:56,730
[Ministry of War Roster]

249
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,800
Those marked with a red check

250
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,960
are no longer alive.

251
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,050
It's only been 17 years,

252
00:11:02,670 --> 00:11:04,670
yet so many of them are already dead.

253
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,090
Could they have been silenced?

254
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:11,440
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

255
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,670
There's one person here

256
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,720
who isn't marked.

257
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:13,870
Could this person

258
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:15,350
still be alive?

259
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,200
This person

260
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,870
went to Mingling County in Qingzhou
many years ago

261
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,730
and disappeared without a trace.

262
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:31,200
Constable Li,

263
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,670
the Chief has summoned everyone.

264
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:33,440
The entire Divine Constable Bureau

265
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,900
is to convene
in the Chief Constable's Hall.

266
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:40,260
[Clear as a Mirror]

267
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:02,960
Everyone,

268
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:06,200
the third black chest has arrived.

269
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,360
It was left right

270
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,600
at the entrance
to the Divine Constable Bureau.

271
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,480
We don't know when it was placed there.

272
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,540
Open it.

273
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:42,440
[Severe-Cold]

274
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:42,790
Look.

275
00:12:42,910 --> 00:12:44,870
The inscription on this sword
reads "Severe-Cold."

276
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:46,200
The Severe-Cold Sword?

277
00:12:46,430 --> 00:12:48,160
Does this black chest warning mean

278
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,560
Meng Rui will kill again?

279
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:58,050
Though the likeness is crude,

280
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,200
the pattern on the armor

281
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:01,870
is unmistakable.

282
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,120
The plum-dyed Xuan Bird—

283
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,750
the insignia of a First-Rank
Senior Grand Secretary.

284
00:13:07,750 --> 00:13:08,720
That's Grand Secretary Bai.

285
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,670
After all,

286
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,910
Grand Secretary Bai was the mastermind

287
00:13:10,910 --> 00:13:13,710
of the alliance that hunted down
Dao Yin back then.

288
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,320
Now,

289
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:19,480
Grand Secretary Bai is training troops
at the Vanguard Camp

290
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,600
outside the city

291
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,480
to prepare
for Northern Kun's southward advance.

292
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,960
All members
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

293
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,960
you are ordered to leave the city at once
and head to the Vanguard Camp.

294
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,150
Protect the Grand Secretary

295
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:28,200
at all costs.

296
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,390
-Yes!
-Yes!

297
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:39,270
The Ministry of Justice is here
by imperial order to investigate.

298
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:41,200
No one is allowed in or out.

299
00:13:43,750 --> 00:13:44,910
The Divine Constable Bureau

300
00:13:44,910 --> 00:13:46,320
operates independently
of the Six Ministries.

301
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,360
Since when does the Ministry of Justice

302
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,240
have the authority

303
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,970
to decide whether we come or go?

304
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,250
When will the Chief arrive?

305
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,960
This is a matter of great importance.

306
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,600
The Chief is in the palace
seeking His Majesty's permission.

307
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,660
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

308
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:04,170
It's finally here.

309
00:14:04,270 --> 00:14:06,330
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

310
00:14:07,750 --> 00:14:09,790
By the Crown Prince's decree,

311
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,390
all members of the Divine Constable Bureau
are ordered to enter the Vanguard Camp

312
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:13,320
and protect the Grand Secretary

313
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,360
while apprehending the culprit.

314
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,270
Do not delay.

315
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,150
Do you hear that?

316
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,600
Do not delay!

317
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,200
Go report this to Lord Xiao.

318
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:22,870
Yes.

319
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,390
We're here on urgent business.

320
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,480
Please inform

321
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:33,590
the Commander and Cavalry Commander
at the Vanguard Camp

322
00:14:33,590 --> 00:14:34,790
to come down and receive us.

323
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:36,000
Didn't you hear us?

324
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,870
Move!

325
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:40,960
Step aside.

326
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:44,440
Well?

327
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:50,970
[Vanguard]

328
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,960
Wasn't I impressive just now?

329
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,320
You're formidable, Eunuch Zhao.

330
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,120
So,

331
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,600
has the Crown Prince awakened?

332
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,390
He's still drunk in your room.

333
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:52,910
Eunuch Zhao,

334
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:56,410
you falsely relayed
the Crown Prince's decree?

335
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:58,640
Wasn't I doing it for your sake?

336
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:01,390
Thank you, Eunuch Zhao.

337
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,380
What's wrong?

338
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:07,600
Are you cold?

339
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:09,480
Why are you trembling?

340
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:10,840
What else? I-I heard that

341
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,870
whenever Meng Rui draws
that wailing sword,

342
00:15:11,870 --> 00:15:12,390
someone dies.

343
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:14,080
If not
for the Crown Prince's oral decree,

344
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,280
I wouldn't have come.

345
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:16,720
Just remember

346
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,960
to protect me later,

347
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,670
all right?

348
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:20,080
Eunuch Zhao,

349
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,530
should I

350
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,960
focus on capturing Meng Rui

351
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,640
to earn merit for the Crown Prince,

352
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,700
or on protecting you?

353
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:28,440
Well...

354
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:29,790
the Crown Prince's business

355
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:30,850
is more important.

356
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,080
Grand Secretary,

357
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:51,320
these soldiers are indeed formidable.

358
00:15:51,390 --> 00:15:53,670
They are the finest of the finest

359
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:56,420
from every camp across Great Shi,

360
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:58,750
forged through countless trials.

361
00:15:58,750 --> 00:15:59,750
When the two armies clash,

362
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:00,910
they charge fearlessly into battle,

363
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,720
fighting solely for Great Shi.

364
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,470
With soldiers like these,

365
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:06,510
Great Shi has nothing to fear
from Northern Kun's army.

366
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:07,240
Grand Secretary, have you

367
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,510
given these newly trained warriors

368
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,510
a name?

369
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:14,120
The Soldiers of Sorrow.

370
00:16:19,010 --> 00:16:20,680
[Vanguard]

371
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,240
Fight! Fight! Fight!

372
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:25,670
"Under Heaven, we are all travelers,

373
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:27,720
united in sorrow
beneath the dust of ages."

374
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,200
What a fitting name.
The Soldiers of Sorrow

375
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,550
embodies a spirit
as impassioned as a song,

376
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:33,480
treating death as lightly as dust.

377
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:37,150
Are you also
from the Divine Constable Bureau?

378
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:39,410
Yes, Grand Secretary.

379
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,600
I'm Li Si,

380
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:43,850
a trainee constable
with the Divine Constable Bureau.

381
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,600
The bell in the black chest warning

382
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,910
clearly indicated midnight.

383
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,720
Midnight

384
00:17:04,130 --> 00:17:05,270
has now passed.

385
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:10,750
My thanks to His Highness
the Crown Prince

386
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:13,200
and everyone from
the Divine Constable Bureau.

387
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,510
My deepest thanks.

388
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:28,410
Protect the Grand Secretary!

389
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:42,030
Where is he?

390
00:17:46,210 --> 00:17:47,340
Split up and search!

391
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,350
Yan, you stay here.

392
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:08,160
Grand Secretary, come with me.

393
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:08,790
All right.

394
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,750
Meng Rui,

395
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,790
don't go any further down this wrong path.

396
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:16,590
Meng Rui,

397
00:18:17,270 --> 00:18:18,590
why are you doing this?

398
00:18:23,590 --> 00:18:24,350
It's you.

399
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:36,350
Grand Secretary, it's safe here.

400
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,330
Grand Secretary, rest in peace.

401
00:19:01,550 --> 00:19:02,400
Lord Lou,

402
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,310
why don't you guess

403
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,280
when Meng Rui and I

404
00:19:06,370 --> 00:19:08,730
swapped outfits?

405
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:10,590
And when

406
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:13,710
Meng Rui and the Grand Secretary

407
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,530
swapped outfits?

408
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:22,790
What if

409
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,200
the black chest

410
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:25,350
wasn't merely meant

411
00:19:25,350 --> 00:19:27,260
to frame the Netherworld Swordsman,

412
00:19:27,260 --> 00:19:29,060
but the warning itself

413
00:19:29,510 --> 00:19:30,790
was an essential part

414
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:32,510
of the culprit's plan?

415
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,880
If the culprit wants to frame me,

416
00:19:37,090 --> 00:19:38,510
their next target

417
00:19:38,530 --> 00:19:39,480
must be Grand Secretary Bai—

418
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:40,720
one of the people

419
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:43,830
who hunted down the Old Man back then.

420
00:19:43,830 --> 00:19:44,640
Why don't we

421
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:45,790
wait for

422
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:47,480
the third black chest to appear,

423
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:49,880
then turn their plan against them?

424
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,940
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

425
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,880
It's finally here.

426
00:19:58,310 --> 00:19:59,160
Meng Rui hid

427
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,490
among Eunuch Zhao's men

428
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:02,520
and infiltrated the military camp.

429
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:09,910
Grand Secretary, come with me.

430
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:19,200
Lord Lou,

431
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:22,270
you had your men
assassinate the Grand Secretary,

432
00:20:22,270 --> 00:20:24,500
just as foretold
in the black chest warning.

433
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:26,630
But you knew perfectly well

434
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:29,400
that this military camp
was full of highly skilled fighters,

435
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,330
so your men could never succeed.

436
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:34,180
Your real plan

437
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,590
was to use the chaos

438
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:37,970
to take the Grand Secretary away.

439
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:39,070
Then, once the two of you

440
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,670
were alone,

441
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:43,740
you would
seize the opportunity to kill him.

442
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:45,640
Am I right?

443
00:20:46,070 --> 00:20:47,510
So we turned your plan against you

444
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:48,660
and swapped outfits.

445
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:50,000
I disguised myself
as Grand Secretary Bai,

446
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:50,880
while Li Si disguised himself as me

447
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:51,880
and drew everyone else away.

448
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:52,480
The goal was to lure the real culprit—

449
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,010
you—into making your move.

450
00:20:59,310 --> 00:21:01,240
The first two black chest warnings

451
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:03,510
were your doing as well,
weren't they, Lord Lou?

452
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:05,110
Your goal

453
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:07,000
was to make everyone believe

454
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:10,240
that the black chest warnings
were genuine,

455
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,140
that Meng Rui

456
00:21:12,210 --> 00:21:14,670
would definitely kill the Grand Secretary.

457
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:15,830
That way,

458
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:18,400
you could openly approach
the Grand Secretary

459
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:20,110
under the pretext

460
00:21:20,130 --> 00:21:21,130
of protecting him

461
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:25,320
and then kill him.

462
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:31,510
I never thought

463
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:34,070
that despite all my careful planning,

464
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:36,030
I couldn't fool you,
Young Master Qingyang.

465
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:37,140
Lou Tianming,

466
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:39,260
we've worked together for years.

467
00:21:39,270 --> 00:21:40,440
Why?

468
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,920
The victor becomes king, and the loser
becomes a bandit. Enough talk.

469
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:42,880
Come at me together.

470
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:43,830
You treacherous bastard.

471
00:21:43,830 --> 00:21:44,590
This place is crawling with experts.

472
00:21:44,590 --> 00:21:45,720
Do you really think you can escape?

473
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,850
Today, I speak for the Eastern Palace—

474
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:51,130
Lou Tianming,

475
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:52,350
surrender!

476
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,310
Do you think
taking that damn eunuch hostage

477
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:53,920
will save your life?

478
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,270
Who are you calling a damn eunuch?

479
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,160
Let me tell you:

480
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,480
if I lose even a single hair,

481
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:58,640
I'll report you to the Crown Prince

482
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,970
and have your entire household executed.

483
00:22:16,510 --> 00:22:18,000
I clearly killed them.

484
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:20,320
What the hell are these things?

485
00:22:20,510 --> 00:22:22,480
Why won't they die?

486
00:23:33,830 --> 00:23:34,920
This beast

487
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:37,270
is one you raised
at the Divine Constable Bureau.

488
00:23:37,270 --> 00:23:38,680
Naturally, it knows

489
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:40,130
the people of the Divine Constable Bureau

490
00:23:40,130 --> 00:23:41,450
are friends, not foes.

491
00:23:42,510 --> 00:23:43,830
You've been known
as the Constable Eagle

492
00:23:43,830 --> 00:23:45,000
for 10 years.

493
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:46,310
How is it

494
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:48,920
that you're not as perceptive as it?

495
00:23:59,050 --> 00:24:00,080
It's you people.

496
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:10,770
Protect the Grand Secretary!

497
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:12,900
Protect the Grand Secretary!

498
00:24:12,900 --> 00:24:14,560
Protect the Grand Secretary!

499
00:24:24,590 --> 00:24:25,270
Meng Rui!

500
00:24:25,300 --> 00:24:26,110
Come back!

501
00:24:26,830 --> 00:24:27,640
Yan,

502
00:24:29,090 --> 00:24:31,350
be careful. Don't let them lure you away.

503
00:24:56,850 --> 00:24:59,710
What a fine display of mastery
over objects with qi.

504
00:25:04,050 --> 00:25:05,300
Greetings, Chief.

505
00:25:06,270 --> 00:25:07,530
For the past few years,

506
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,270
I've entrusted
nearly all the day-to-day affairs

507
00:25:09,270 --> 00:25:10,880
of the Divine Constable Bureau

508
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,110
to you.

509
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:14,620
Everyone in and out of court says

510
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:15,990
that sooner or later,

511
00:25:16,220 --> 00:25:18,170
you'll take my place.

512
00:25:18,610 --> 00:25:19,860
Chief,

513
00:25:20,500 --> 00:25:22,430
I will never forget your kindness.

514
00:25:23,250 --> 00:25:25,110
It's enough that you remember it.

515
00:25:26,730 --> 00:25:28,570
You needn't hold back now.

516
00:25:30,710 --> 00:25:31,680
In the jianghu,

517
00:25:32,090 --> 00:25:33,850
there have been two ten-year periods.

518
00:25:33,850 --> 00:25:35,050
In the first,

519
00:25:35,350 --> 00:25:37,650
the Netherworld Swordsman tested
his swordsmanship against the world.

520
00:25:37,650 --> 00:25:38,790
In the second,

521
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:41,760
Chief Xuanyuan reigned supreme.

522
00:25:42,830 --> 00:25:44,030
Tonight, I am honored

523
00:25:44,370 --> 00:25:47,290
to witness the skills

524
00:25:47,310 --> 00:25:49,310
of the greatest female martial artist
in history.

525
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:50,850
Greatest of all time

526
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:51,930
is too much.

527
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,640
But adding "female"

528
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:55,270
to the title

529
00:25:55,650 --> 00:25:57,450
would be looking down on me.

530
00:25:57,720 --> 00:25:58,850
You may leave it out.

531
00:25:59,270 --> 00:26:01,950
Then, let the greatest martial artist
of our time make the first move

532
00:26:01,950 --> 00:26:03,650
and show me the legendary technique,

533
00:26:03,650 --> 00:26:06,030
"Clouds Veil the Mist,
Stars Split the Heavens;

534
00:26:06,030 --> 00:26:09,230
Jade Pendants and Gold Ornaments
Set the World in Order."

535
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,640
Who are you?

536
00:27:21,430 --> 00:27:22,640
What are you after?

537
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:23,900
Why did you kill my family?

538
00:27:23,900 --> 00:27:24,620
Speak!

539
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,030
Come on!

540
00:28:08,390 --> 00:28:09,190
Tell me,

541
00:28:09,310 --> 00:28:10,750
who are you people?

542
00:28:10,750 --> 00:28:11,540
Speak!

543
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,140
Brother!

544
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,740
[Vanguard]

545
00:28:50,310 --> 00:28:51,110
Are you all right?

546
00:28:51,110 --> 00:28:51,880
Just sprinkle it on. That should do it.

547
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,480
Be careful.

548
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:54,280
Bear with it. It'll be over soon.

549
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,070
How is he?

550
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:57,400
He's much better.

551
00:29:00,310 --> 00:29:02,440
Zhenzhu, is it okay to tie it like this?

552
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:03,590
No problem.

553
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:05,310
It's done.

554
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:10,490
[Vanguard]

555
00:29:21,510 --> 00:29:24,640
Divine Constable Bureau,
receive the imperial decree.

556
00:29:26,590 --> 00:29:28,250
By His Majesty's oral decree:

557
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:29,400
I have learned

558
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,880
of the crimes of Lou Tianming
and Meng Rui

559
00:29:31,900 --> 00:29:33,220
and am deeply shocked.

560
00:29:33,350 --> 00:29:35,880
Three days remain
of the seven-day deadline.

561
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:38,430
Lou Tianming has now been apprehended.

562
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:40,480
You are to capture Meng Rui at once.

563
00:29:40,480 --> 00:29:42,680
Bring him back alive,
or bring back his body.

564
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:43,440
What?

565
00:29:43,780 --> 00:29:45,000
The truth is clear.

566
00:29:45,110 --> 00:29:46,180
Meng Rui is innocent.

567
00:29:46,180 --> 00:29:47,860
We receive the decree.

568
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:53,640
Chief,

569
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,070
why do we still have to arrest Meng Rui?

570
00:29:55,070 --> 00:29:56,920
Knowing full well
that Meng Rui isn't the culprit,

571
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,910
are we really going to
compound the mistake?

572
00:29:58,910 --> 00:30:00,000
If we can establish exactly

573
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,240
what happened

574
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:02,830
and give His Majesty and Northern Kun
a satisfactory explanation,

575
00:30:02,830 --> 00:30:04,430
can Mr. Meng then be cleared?

576
00:30:04,490 --> 00:30:05,920
His Majesty wants

577
00:30:05,940 --> 00:30:07,640
an explanation

578
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:09,920
that will stabilize the situation for now.

579
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:10,920
I'll return to the Bureau

580
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:13,180
and continue examining Yan Zige's body.

581
00:30:15,070 --> 00:30:15,920
Chief.

582
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:17,110
Once you find Meng Rui,

583
00:30:17,110 --> 00:30:18,910
sound the whistle as the signal.

584
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:20,400
Yes, Chief.

585
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:34,670
You've been
with the Divine Constable Bureau

586
00:30:34,670 --> 00:30:36,310
for 13 years.

587
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:41,040
Thirteen years, seven months,

588
00:30:41,790 --> 00:30:42,920
and nine days.

589
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:50,480
I've always regarded you

590
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:52,240
as my own younger brother.

591
00:30:54,110 --> 00:30:55,030
Why?

592
00:31:01,110 --> 00:31:02,830
Attempting to assassinate
the Grand Secretary

593
00:31:02,830 --> 00:31:04,000
is treason.

594
00:31:04,310 --> 00:31:05,750
And then there are the deaths

595
00:31:05,750 --> 00:31:06,950
of Wenbu and Yan Zige.

596
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:08,000
No one can save you

597
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,930
from the crimes you've committed.

598
00:31:10,070 --> 00:31:11,340
If you won't speak now,

599
00:31:11,370 --> 00:31:12,550
do you intend to take your secrets

600
00:31:12,550 --> 00:31:13,680
to the grave?

601
00:31:15,610 --> 00:31:17,070
Everyone has a grave

602
00:31:19,080 --> 00:31:21,040
in their heart.

603
00:31:22,780 --> 00:31:23,920
The Divine Constable Bureau

604
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:26,110
has 49 forms of torture.

605
00:31:26,510 --> 00:31:29,370
Are you saying
you'd like to experience them today?

606
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:33,720
Thirteen of those

607
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:36,400
were devised by me.

608
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,030
I wonder which one

609
00:31:38,530 --> 00:31:40,400
I'll survive today.

610
00:31:52,790 --> 00:31:53,590
Guards!

611
00:31:53,590 --> 00:31:54,400
Yes.

612
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,920
Take good care of him.

613
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:56,550
Yes.

614
00:32:04,030 --> 00:32:05,510
His Majesty issued the decree

615
00:32:05,510 --> 00:32:07,110
right after you finished
interrogating Lou Tianming.

616
00:32:07,110 --> 00:32:08,510
Effective immediately,

617
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:10,050
the Eastern Palace,
the Ministry of Justice,

618
00:32:10,050 --> 00:32:11,510
and the Court of Judicial Review

619
00:32:11,510 --> 00:32:14,030
may all enter the prison
to interrogate Lou Tianming.

620
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:16,110
Only the Divine Constable Bureau
is forbidden from doing so.

621
00:32:16,110 --> 00:32:17,820
We're to merely keep watch over him.

622
00:32:17,820 --> 00:32:18,450
Wait,

623
00:32:19,710 --> 00:32:21,580
is His Majesty
afraid we'll show favoritism,

624
00:32:21,580 --> 00:32:22,950
or does he suspect
the Divine Constable Bureau?

625
00:32:22,950 --> 00:32:24,010
Watch your tongue.

626
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,200
But Lou Tianming

627
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:27,310
spent years
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

628
00:32:27,310 --> 00:32:29,070
He knows interrogation inside out.

629
00:32:29,070 --> 00:32:30,310
With those people from the Eastern Palace

630
00:32:30,310 --> 00:32:31,030
and the Ministry of Justice,

631
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:33,230
what could they possibly get out of him?

632
00:32:33,610 --> 00:32:34,880
What exactly are those things

633
00:32:34,880 --> 00:32:35,880
under Lou Tianming?

634
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:37,270
What is his real plot?

635
00:32:37,270 --> 00:32:38,830
And what about Wenbu and Yan Zige?

636
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:40,480
So many questions remain unanswered.

637
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:42,880
Are we really
just going to leave it at that?

638
00:32:43,670 --> 00:32:44,470
Yan,

639
00:32:45,730 --> 00:32:46,970
His Majesty said

640
00:32:47,110 --> 00:32:48,590
we're not allowed to interrogate him.

641
00:32:48,590 --> 00:32:49,590
He never said

642
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:51,970
we couldn't keep investigating.

643
00:32:53,150 --> 00:32:53,950
That's true.

644
00:33:11,750 --> 00:33:12,860
Master.

645
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,440
We can't keep Mr. Meng

646
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,510
here forever.

647
00:33:17,490 --> 00:33:19,720
Before Senior Old Geezer left,

648
00:33:19,800 --> 00:33:21,200
he said there was nothing he could do

649
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:22,730
about Mr. Meng's injuries.

650
00:33:22,820 --> 00:33:24,470
If we want to save Mr. Meng,

651
00:33:25,070 --> 00:33:28,270
the only hope is Mr. Tao
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

652
00:33:29,490 --> 00:33:31,550
Yuque has ordered Meng Rui's arrest.

653
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,120
We can't send him back

654
00:33:33,310 --> 00:33:35,310
to the Divine Constable Bureau now.

655
00:33:35,930 --> 00:33:36,740
Not unless

656
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:40,020
I can uncover the truth

657
00:33:40,310 --> 00:33:41,510
and clear his name.

658
00:33:46,810 --> 00:33:48,560
The heart is protected by the breastbone.

659
00:33:48,560 --> 00:33:50,170
No matter how profound
Meng Rui's inner power was,

660
00:33:50,170 --> 00:33:51,110
even if one strike

661
00:33:51,110 --> 00:33:52,480
could shatter Yan Zige's heart meridians,

662
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:53,680
there was no way

663
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:55,080
he could strike his heart

664
00:33:55,140 --> 00:33:57,000
through completely intact ribs.

665
00:33:57,740 --> 00:33:59,180
If the culprit really

666
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,960
wanted to recreate the effect
of the murder warning,

667
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,550
they would have had to calculate exactly

668
00:34:02,550 --> 00:34:04,750
when Wenbu would take the poison
and when it would take effect,

669
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:06,310
down to the last detail.

670
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:09,360
Yan Zige's death was even more mysterious.

671
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:11,110
No one could have predicted in advance

672
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:11,960
which move Meng Rui would use

673
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:13,030
to kill Yan Zige.

674
00:34:13,670 --> 00:34:14,550
And there are

675
00:34:14,550 --> 00:34:15,590
no ghosts or gods in this world

676
00:34:15,590 --> 00:34:17,440
capable of foreseeing the future.

677
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,710
Unless...

678
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:30,770
This is...

679
00:34:32,060 --> 00:34:34,659
A belly feather
from a Western Migrant Bird...

680
00:34:35,530 --> 00:34:36,989
A Western Migrant Bird

681
00:34:37,020 --> 00:34:38,560
grows only 1 belly feather
in its lifetime.

682
00:34:38,560 --> 00:34:40,800
As fine as a strand of hair
yet extraordinarily tough,

683
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:42,190
it can travel through the blood vessels

684
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,280
and sever the heart meridians.

685
00:34:42,530 --> 00:34:46,030
[Clear as a Mirror]

686
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,960
If Yan Zige had been secretly attacked
by someone else,

687
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:47,150
he could never have chosen this moment

688
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:48,260
to duel Meng Rui.

689
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,590
Unless

690
00:34:50,550 --> 00:34:51,710
Yan Zige was the one
who drove this feather

691
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:53,190
into his own body.

692
00:34:55,550 --> 00:34:57,510
The human body
is riddled with blood vessels,

693
00:34:57,510 --> 00:34:58,550
yet you managed

694
00:34:58,680 --> 00:34:59,560
to find

695
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:00,800
such a tiny feather.

696
00:35:01,130 --> 00:35:03,090
Zhenzhu, you did well.

697
00:35:05,770 --> 00:35:06,880
He drove the feather

698
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,840
into his own body,

699
00:35:08,860 --> 00:35:10,530
which means Yan Zige killed himself.

700
00:35:10,530 --> 00:35:12,100
That explains everything.

701
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,230
The reason his death

702
00:35:14,280 --> 00:35:16,260
looked exactly
like the black chest warning

703
00:35:16,260 --> 00:35:17,090
is simply

704
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,810
that Yan Zige killed himself.

705
00:35:18,810 --> 00:35:20,390
Yan Zige willingly took his own life

706
00:35:20,390 --> 00:35:21,840
to make us completely believe

707
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,240
the black chest warning.

708
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:25,110
Combined with the assassination attempt,

709
00:35:25,110 --> 00:35:26,760
it becomes clear that Lou Tianming
planned everything so carefully

710
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,190
simply to make us believe

711
00:35:28,190 --> 00:35:29,670
that the Grand Secretary

712
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:35,690
would be the next to die.

713
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:37,730
Once the Divine Constable Bureau
believed the warning,

714
00:35:37,730 --> 00:35:39,600
we were bound to protect
the Grand Secretary.

715
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:42,880
Lou Tianming could then
seize the opportunity to assassinate him.

716
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:44,940
To assassinate the Grand Secretary,

717
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:48,190
they went to such lengths
and devised such an elaborate trap.

718
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:50,850
They certainly went to great lengths
to plan it.

719
00:35:51,940 --> 00:35:53,780
If the Grand Secretary were to die,

720
00:35:53,780 --> 00:35:55,340
Northern Kun could launch

721
00:35:55,370 --> 00:35:56,710
an all-out war without restraint.

722
00:35:56,710 --> 00:35:57,510
Qingyang.

723
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:01,000
Chief.

724
00:36:01,150 --> 00:36:02,070
You're back.

725
00:36:02,150 --> 00:36:03,680
Where have you been all day?

726
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,190
Thank you for your concern, Chief,

727
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:07,590
and both of you.

728
00:36:08,190 --> 00:36:09,480
I've been searching

729
00:36:09,550 --> 00:36:11,150
for Mr. Meng's whereabouts.

730
00:36:11,810 --> 00:36:12,730
Any leads?

731
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:20,530
Then let's get back to the case.

732
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,590
Based on what we just deduced,

733
00:36:23,050 --> 00:36:24,720
Yan Zige committed suicide.

734
00:36:25,390 --> 00:36:26,590
But what about Wenbu?

735
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:28,190
Just like Yan Zige,

736
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,760
Wenbu would have had
to take the poison himself

737
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:32,510
so that the time of death

738
00:36:32,510 --> 00:36:33,640
could be pinpointed

739
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:35,110
and his body

740
00:36:35,190 --> 00:36:37,720
would match
the black chest warning exactly.

741
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:40,000
Suicide by Yan Zige is one thing,

742
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:42,320
but Wenbu was the Crown Prince
of Northern Kun.

743
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:44,180
He was willing to risk his own life

744
00:36:45,190 --> 00:36:47,420
just to provoke a war
between the two sides?

745
00:36:47,420 --> 00:36:48,790
For years,

746
00:36:49,190 --> 00:36:51,000
tensions had been simmering
between us and Northern Kun.

747
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,930
War is a test of national strength,

748
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:54,070
and over time,

749
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,490
many in Northern Kun

750
00:36:55,590 --> 00:36:57,710
had come to favor peace.

751
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:58,970
But now

752
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,880
that the Crown Prince is dead,

753
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:02,860
the peace faction in Northern Kun

754
00:37:02,930 --> 00:37:04,190
has been silenced.

755
00:37:05,190 --> 00:37:06,400
The entire nation

756
00:37:06,590 --> 00:37:07,780
is united against us

757
00:37:08,130 --> 00:37:09,710
and launches
a massive invasion of the south.

758
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:10,990
But even

759
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:13,510
if Northern Kun wins,

760
00:37:13,590 --> 00:37:14,900
the Crown Prince is still dead.

761
00:37:14,900 --> 00:37:16,260
What would be the point?

762
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,740
It doesn't make sense.

763
00:37:19,040 --> 00:37:20,730
Corpse-Dissolving Powder.

764
00:37:21,470 --> 00:37:22,360
No wonder.

765
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,360
Once the body dissolved,

766
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:26,910
it would be impossible
to determine the true identity.

767
00:37:26,910 --> 00:37:28,110
The man who died

768
00:37:28,110 --> 00:37:29,640
wasn't Crown Prince Wenbu.

769
00:37:30,110 --> 00:37:31,150
It was a substitute.

770
00:37:31,150 --> 00:37:33,670
Yan Zige took his own life.
Wenbu died.

771
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:35,710
The two nations went to war,

772
00:37:36,100 --> 00:37:37,430
and no one could stop it.

773
00:37:37,510 --> 00:37:38,440
At the same time,

774
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:39,900
if the Grand Secretary were to die,

775
00:37:39,900 --> 00:37:41,720
Northern Kun's chances
of victory would increase dramatically.

776
00:37:41,720 --> 00:37:43,720
That was their motive.

777
00:37:44,510 --> 00:37:45,360
But what exactly is Lou Tianming

778
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:46,620
trying to accomplish?

779
00:37:47,150 --> 00:37:48,880
What does he stand to gain

780
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:51,190
from a war between Northern Kun
and Great Shi?

781
00:37:51,190 --> 00:37:52,190
That is something

782
00:37:52,550 --> 00:37:54,880
we'll have to ask Lou Tianming ourselves.

783
00:37:55,150 --> 00:37:55,960
Chief.

784
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,280
Chief,

785
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:59,860
Lou Tianming has escaped.

786
00:38:03,460 --> 00:38:04,300
Chief.

787
00:38:14,150 --> 00:38:15,150
How could this have happened?

788
00:38:15,150 --> 00:38:16,360
He was tortured

789
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:18,210
and had no way of escaping on his own.

790
00:38:18,210 --> 00:38:19,880
Someone must have tampered with things.

791
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:21,130
It's no easy feat for an outsider

792
00:38:21,130 --> 00:38:22,160
to get into the Divine Constable Bureau,

793
00:38:22,160 --> 00:38:24,120
let alone get someone out.

794
00:38:25,230 --> 00:38:26,030
Could there be

795
00:38:26,700 --> 00:38:28,240
a mole within the Divine Constable Bureau?
